 "content": "[{\"type\":\"header\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<span class=\\\"h4\\\"><b>Drum Labelling</b></span>\",\"col\":12}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>1.</b> QA keeps the approved <b>Master Labels</b> (label no., title, storage).&nbsp; <b>2.</b> Production fills the <b>Label Requisition Form</b> (batch, drums, weights) and sends it for approval.&nbsp; <b>3.</b> After approval: open the LRF &rarr; <b>Print &rsaquo; All Labels</b> to print the drum stickers.\",\"col\":12}},{\"type\":\"shortcut\",\"data\":{\"shortcut_name\":\"Label Requisition Form\",\"col\":4}},{\"type\":\"shortcut\",\"data\":{\"shortcut_name\":\"Master Label\",\"col\":4}},{\"type\":\"shortcut\",\"data\":{\"shortcut_name\":\"Labelling Settings\",\"col\":4}},{\"type\":\"spacer\",\"data\":{\"col\":12}},{\"type\":\"header\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<span class=\\\"h4\\\"><b>Reports &amp; Masters</b></span>\",\"col\":12}},{\"type\":\"card\",\"data\":{\"card_name\":\"Labelling\",\"col\":4}},{\"type\":\"card\",\"data\":{\"card_name\":\"Related\",\"col\":4}}]",
